---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Felt og prosjekt" activeNav="field">
  <main class="field-shell">
    <section class="field-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Styr.ing · felt og prosjekt</span><h1>Koble arbeidet<br /><em>til kostnaden.</em></h1><p>Få kjørebok, vedlikehold, FDV, prosjekter, timer og fakturagrunnlag inn i samme spor — med et tydelig stoppunkt før skatte- eller fakturagrunnlag godkjennes.</p><a href="#field-work" class="primary">Åpne feltbildet ↓</a></div><div class="field-orb"><strong id="hero-projects">—</strong><span>aktive prosjekter</span><small id="hero-hours">— timer i kø</small></div></section>
    <section class="metrics"><article><span>Aktive kjøretøy</span><strong id="m-fleet">—</strong><small>med neste kontroll</small></article><article><span>Kjørebok</span><strong id="m-trips">—</strong><small>turer mangler klassifisering</small></article><article><span>Fakturagrunnlag</span><strong id="m-wip">—</strong><small>godkjente timer i verdi</small></article><article class="dark"><span>Feltoppgaver</span><strong id="m-facilities">—</strong><small>FDV/HMS krever oppfølging</small></article></section>
    <section id="field-work" class="workspace"><div class="head"><div><span class="kicker">Operativt feltregister</span><h2 id="view-title">Kjøretøy og kjørebok</h2></div><span id="status">Henter…</span></div><nav class="tabs">{[['fleet','Kjøretøy'],['trips','Kjørebok'],['maintenance','Vedlikehold'],['facilities','FDV'],['projects','Prosjekter'],['rates','Priser og margin'],['time','Timer'],['wip','WIP'],['invoice_drafts','Fakturautkast']].map(([key,label],i)=><button class={i===0?'active':''} data-view={key}>{label}</button>)}</nav><div id="list"></div></section>
    <section class="actions"><div><span class="kicker">Kontrollert feltarbeid</span><h2>Flytt neste oppgave frem.</h2><p>Handlingene krever eier- eller redaktørrolle. GPS, skatteberegning og EHF forblir deaktivert uten godkjente datakilder og avtaler.</p></div><div class="action-grid">
      <form id="trip-form"><strong>Klassifiser kjøretur</strong><label>Tur<select id="trip-select" name="tripId" required></select></label><label>Type<select name="tripType"><option value="business">Yrkesreise</option><option value="private">Privat</option><option value="commute">Arbeidsreise</option><option value="unknown">Uavklart</option></select></label><button type="submit">Klassifiser tur</button></form>
      <form id="maintenance-form"><strong>Fullfør vedlikehold</strong><label>Oppgave<select id="maintenance-select" name="maintenanceId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Marker fullført</button><small>Dokumentasjon og kostnad må fortsatt legges ved eksternt.</small></form>
      <form id="facility-form"><strong>Fullfør FDV-oppgave</strong><label>Kontrollpunkt<select id="facility-task-select" name="taskId" required></select></label><label>Dokumentasjonsreferanse<input name="evidenceRef" maxlength="500" placeholder="Lenke eller arkiv-ID (valgfritt)" /></label><button type="submit">Marker kontrollert</button><small>Oppdaterer status og spor — bestilling skjer ikke automatisk.</small></form>
      <form id="time-entry-form"><strong>Før timer</strong><label>Prosjekt<select id="time-entry-project-select" name="projectId" required></select></label><label>Person<select id="time-entry-person-select" name="personId" required></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Dato<input type="date" name="workDate" required /></label><label>Minutter<input type="number" name="minutes" min="1" max="1440" step="1" required placeholder="60" /></label></div><label>Beskrivelse<input name="description" maxlength="500" placeholder="Hva ble gjort?" /></label><button type="submit">Lagre som utkast</button><small>Sendes til kontroll før fakturagrunnlag.</small></form>
      <form id="time-submit-form"><strong>Send timer til kontroll</strong><label>Timeføring<select id="time-draft-select" name="entryId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Send inn</button><small>Godkjenner må fortsatt kontrollere før bruk.</small></form>
      <form id="invoice-form"><strong>Forbered fakturautkast</strong><label>Prosjekt<select id="project-select" name="projectId" required></select></label><label>Periode<input name="period" required placeholder="2026-08" /></label><button type="submit">Forbered utkast</button></form>
      <form id="time-approval-form"><strong>Godkjenn timer</strong><label>Timeføring<select id="time-select" name="entryId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn timeføring</button><small>Oppdaterer kontrollsporet, ikke lønn eller fakturering.</small></form>
      <form id="draft-approval-form"><strong>Godkjenn fakturautkast</strong><label>Utkast<select id="draft-select" name="draftId" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn utkast</button><small>Ekstern fakturering og EHF er ikke aktivert.</small></form>
    </div><p id="action-status" class="action-status" role="status" hidden></p></section>
    <section class="notice"><strong>Produksjonsgrense</strong><p>GPS, Skatteetaten-beregning, fakturering og EHF-utsending krever samtykke, datakilder, leverandøravtaler og menneskelig kontroll. Styr.ing viser grunnlaget — den sender eller rapporterer ikke automatisk.</p></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script is:inline>
  const esc = value => String(value ?? '').replace(/[&<>'"]/g, char => ({ '&':'&amp;', '<':'&lt;', '>':'&gt;', "'":'&#39;', '"':'&quot;' }[char]));
  const list = document.getElementById('list'); const status = document.getElementById('status');
  const labels = { active:'Aktiv', draft:'Utkast', classified:'Klassifisert', approved:'Godkjent', scheduled:'Planlagt', open:'Åpen', submitted:'Innsendt', complete:'Ferdig', hourly:'Timepris', prepared:'Forberedt', review:'Til kontroll' };
  const pill = value => `<em class="pill">${esc(labels[value] || value || '—')}</em>`;
  const money = value => `${new Intl.NumberFormat('nb-NO').format(Number(value || 0) / 100)} NOK`;
  const render = (view, rows) => { const f = {
    fleet:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.registration)} · ${esc(r.make_model)}</strong><p>${esc(r.owner_name||'Uten eier')} · ${esc(r.odometer_km)} km</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>EU-kontroll ${esc(r.next_inspection_date||'—')}</small></article>`,
    trips:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.trip_date)} · ${esc(r.start_location)} → ${esc(r.end_location)}</strong><p>${esc(r.driver_name||'Ukjent fører')} · ${esc(r.purpose||'Uten formål')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}${pill(r.trip_type)}<small>${esc(r.distance_km)} km</small></article>`,
    maintenance:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.title)}</strong><p>${esc(r.registration)} · ${esc(r.vendor||'Leverandør ikke satt')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>Frist ${esc(r.due_date)} · ${money(r.cost_minor)}</small></article>`,
    facilities:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.address||'Adresse ikke satt')} · ${esc(r.owner_name||'Uten eier')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>FDV-objekt</small></article>`,
    projects:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.company_name||'Internt prosjekt')} · ${esc(r.billing_model)}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>Budsjett ${money(r.budget_minor)}</small></article>`,
    rates:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.project_name)} · ${esc(r.role)}</strong><p>Pris ${money(r.hourly_minor)}/t · kostbasis ${money(r.cost_hourly_minor)}/t</p></div>${pill(r.source||'manual')}<small>Gyldig fra ${esc(r.valid_from||'—')}</small></article>`,
    time:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.work_date)} · ${esc(r.project_code)} · ${esc(r.person_name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.description||'Uten beskrivelse')} · ${r.billable?'Fakturerbar':'Ikke fakturerbar'}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<small>${Math.round(Number(r.minutes||0)/60*10)/10} t</small></article>`,
    wip:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.company_name||'Internt prosjekt')} · ${esc(r.entry_count||0)} godkjente fakturerbare timer</p></div><span><b>${money(r.amount_minor)}</b><small>kost ${money(r.cost_minor)} · margin ${money(Number(r.amount_minor||0)-Number(r.cost_minor||0))}</small></span></article>`,
    invoice_drafts:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.period)} fakturautkast</strong><p>${esc(r.company_name||'Uten kunde')} · ${esc(r.source_minutes||0)} minutter fra timer</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<b>${money(r.amount_minor)}</b></article>`
  }; list.innerHTML = rows.length ? rows.map(f[view]).join('') : '<p class="empty">Ingen registrerte rader.</p>'; };
  const load = async view => { try { const data = await (await fetch(`/api/field?boardId=board-1&view=${view}`)).json(); render(view, data.data || []); status.textContent = `${(data.data || []).length} poster · kilde synlig`; } catch { status.textContent = 'API utilgjengelig'; } };
  const summary = async () => { try { const data = (await (await fetch('/api/field?boardId=board-1&view=summary')).json()).data || {}; document.getElementById('m-fleet').textContent = data.fleet?.count ?? 0; document.getElementById('m-trips').textContent = data.trips?.count ?? 0; document.getElementById('m-wip').textContent = money(data.wip?.amount_minor); document.getElementById('m-facilities').textContent = data.facilities?.count ?? 0; document.getElementById('hero-projects').textContent = data.projects?.count ?? 0; document.getElementById('hero-hours').textContent = `${Math.round(Number(data.time?.minutes || 0)/60*10)/10} timer i kø`; } catch {} };
  const api = async payload => { const response = await fetch('/api/field', { method:'POST', headers:{'content-type':'application/json'}, body:JSON.stringify({ boardId:'board-1', ...payload }) }); const data = await response.json(); if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || 'request_failed'); return data; };
  const fillOptions = async () => { const [trips, maintenance, facilityTasks, projects, people, time, drafts] = await Promise.all(['trips','maintenance','facility_tasks','projects','people','time','invoice_drafts'].map(view => fetch(`/api/field?boardId=board-1&view=${view}`).then(r=>r.json()))); const set = (id, rows, empty, label) => { document.getElementById(id).innerHTML = rows.length ? rows.map(label).join('') : `<option value="">${empty}</option>`; }; set('trip-select',(trips.data||[]).filter(r=>r.status==='draft'),'Ingen turer til kontroll',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.trip_date)} · ${esc(r.start_location)} → ${esc(r.end_location)}</option>`); set('maintenance-select',(maintenance.data||[]).filter(r=>['scheduled','booked','overdue'].includes(r.status)),'Ingen åpne oppgaver',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.registration)} · ${esc(r.title)}</option>`); set('facility-task-select',(facilityTasks.data||[]).filter(r=>['open','scheduled','overdue'].includes(r.status)),'Ingen åpne FDV-oppgaver',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.facility_name)} · ${esc(r.title)}</option>`); const activeProjects=(projects.data||[]).filter(r=>r.status==='active'); set('project-select',activeProjects,'Ingen aktive prosjekter',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</option>`); set('time-entry-project-select',activeProjects,'Ingen aktive prosjekter',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.name)}</option>`); set('time-entry-person-select',people.data||[],'Ingen aktive personer',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.name)} · ${esc(r.role||'')}</option>`); const draftsTime=(time.data||[]).filter(r=>r.status==='draft'); set('time-draft-select',draftsTime,'Ingen timeutkast',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.work_date)} · ${esc(r.project_code)} · ${esc(r.person_name)} · ${esc(r.minutes)} min</option>`); set('time-select',(time.data||[]).filter(r=>r.status==='submitted'),'Ingen timer til kontroll',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.work_date)} · ${esc(r.project_code)} · ${esc(r.person_name)}</option>`); set('draft-select',(drafts.data||[]).filter(r=>['prepared','review'].includes(r.status)),'Ingen utkast til kontroll',r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.code)} · ${esc(r.period)} · ${money(r.amount_minor)}</option>`); };
  const actionStatus = document.getElementById('action-status'); const post = async payload => { await api(payload); actionStatus.hidden=false; actionStatus.classList.remove('error'); actionStatus.textContent='Endringen er lagret og auditert.'; await Promise.all([summary(),fillOptions(),load(document.querySelector('.tabs button.active')?.dataset.view || 'fleet')]); };
  const bind = (id, payload) => document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('submit', async event => { event.preventDefault(); try { const form = new FormData(event.currentTarget); await post(payload(form)); } catch (error) { actionStatus.hidden=false; actionStatus.classList.add('error'); actionStatus.textContent = error.message === 'write_not_authorized' ? 'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.' : 'Handlingen kunne ikke lagres.'; } });
  bind('trip-form',f=>({action:'classify_trip',tripId:f.get('tripId'),tripType:f.get('tripType')})); bind('maintenance-form',f=>({action:'complete_maintenance',maintenanceId:f.get('maintenanceId')})); bind('facility-form',f=>({action:'complete_facility_task',taskId:f.get('taskId'),evidenceRef:f.get('evidenceRef')})); bind('time-entry-form',f=>({action:'create_time_entry',projectId:f.get('projectId'),personId:f.get('personId'),workDate:f.get('workDate'),minutes:f.get('minutes'),description:f.get('description'),billable:true})); bind('time-submit-form',f=>({action:'submit_time',entryId:f.get('entryId')})); bind('invoice-form',f=>({action:'prepare_invoice',projectId:f.get('projectId'),period:f.get('period')})); bind('time-approval-form',f=>({action:'approve_time',entryId:f.get('entryId')})); bind('draft-approval-form',f=>({action:'approve_invoice_draft',draftId:f.get('draftId')}));
  document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(item=>item.classList.remove('active'));button.classList.add('active');load(button.dataset.view);})); Promise.all([summary(),fillOptions(),load('fleet')]);
</script>
<style>
  .field-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:38px 24px 80px}.field-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .45fr;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:44px;border-radius:27px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#263a43,#35707a);color:#fff}.eyebrow,.kicker{font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c5eee7}.field-hero h1{margin:20px 0 16px;font:500 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.4rem)/.96 Georgia,serif}.field-hero h1 em{color:#c3f3bc;font-style:normal}.field-hero p{max-width:570px;color:#ffffffbf;font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}.primary{display:inline-flex;margin-top:22px;padding:13px 17px;border-radius:10px;background:#c8f4bf;color:#21413d;font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.field-orb{width:190px;height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #c5eee7aa;border-radius:50%;background:#255763;color:#fff}.field-orb strong{font:500 3.2rem Georgia,serif;color:#d0ffc4}.field-orb span,.field-orb small{font:.68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.field-orb small{margin-top:9px;color:#b9dfdb}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:16px 0 52px}.metrics article{min-height:105px;padding:17px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:15px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.metrics .dark{background:#10241f;color:#fff}.metrics span,.metrics small{color:#718078;font:600 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif}.metrics strong{font:500 1.7rem Georgia,serif}.metrics small{color:#478f68}.workspace{padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.head h2{margin:9px 0 0;font:500 2.1rem Georgia,serif}.head>span{color:#718078;font:.7rem system-ui,sans-serif}.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow:auto;margin:25px 0 12px}.tabs button{padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:9px;background:#fafbf9;color:#65746b;cursor:pointer;font:700 .72rem system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.tabs button.active{background:#255763;color:#fff}.workspace article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr auto auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:15px 4px;border-top:1px solid #10241f12}.workspace strong{font:600 .82rem system-ui,sans-serif}.workspace p,.workspace small{margin:5px 0 0;color:#718078;font:.7rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.pill{padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#e9f3f5;color:#286977;font:700 .61rem system-ui,sans-serif;font-style:normal;white-space:nowrap}.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:28px;margin-top:35px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:18px;background:#edf5f3}.actions h2{margin:9px 0 7px;font:500 1.8rem Georgia,serif}.actions p{color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}.action-grid form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;padding:15px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:13px;background:#fff}.action-grid strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;color:#718078;font:600 .62rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid input,.action-grid select{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid #10241f26;border-radius:8px;background:#fbfdfb;font:.71rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-grid button{margin-top:auto;padding:9px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#255763;color:#fff;font:700 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.action-grid small{color:#718078;font:.66rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.action-status{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:1.2em;margin:0;color:#286977;font:700 .72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status.error{color:#a33f35}.notice{margin-top:35px;padding:22px 25px;border-radius:16px;background:#edf5f3}.notice strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.notice p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}@media(max-width:800px){.field-hero,.actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:560px){.field-shell{padding:20px 15px 55px}.field-hero{padding:28px 22px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workspace{padding:20px 16px}.head{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}.workspace article{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.workspace article small{grid-column:1}.action-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
